# Installed as
# /usr/share/qcom-firmware-extract/provided.d/microsoft,surface-laptop-8-13p8.list
# and microsoft,surface-laptop-8-15.list; both sizes start the same SOCCP images.
#
# The SOCCP (battery, charging and USB-C) firmware. The laptop's boot firmware
# starts the SOCCP before Linux from images inside the system firmware, and
# Linux attaches to it. No Windows driver package carries these files.
qcom/glymur/microsoft/surface-laptop8/soccp.mbn
qcom/glymur/microsoft/surface-laptop8/soccp_dtb.mbn
# The USB4 router firmware, one image for each USB-C port's router. They are
# inside Qualcomm's Windows USB4 driver rather than files of their own;
# surface-laptop8-usb4-firmware copies them out.
qcom/glymur/surface-laptop8/usb4-router-legacy.bin
qcom/glymur/surface-laptop8/usb4-router-v2.bin
